/target
# Cargo.lock is deliberately tracked, not ignored. The usual "a library does not
# commit a lockfile" rule does not apply: this crate compiles to a WASM artifact
# that is deployed and audited, so its dependency set has to be reproducible.
# Ignoring it meant a clean checkout resolved soroban-sdk 22's transitive deps to
# ed25519-dalek 3.0.0 and failed to build at all (#908).
# Soroban test snapshots are regenerated on every `cargo test` run.
/test_snapshots
